The '''Palace Bridge''' is a [[Location]] in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, found above the {{Zone|Royal Mines}} and before the {{Zone|Royal Palace}}. 

== Overview ==
The '''Palace Bridge''' grants access to the {{Zone|Royal Palace}}. Dropping down also grants access to the {{Zone|Royal Mines}} and {{Zone|The Mist}}.

